text.section:
After the conversion is approved by the partners, the general partnership shall file a certificate of limited partnership that meets the requirements of § 50-73.11 and includes the following:

The name of the former general partnership and the identification number issued by the Commission to the general partnership, if any;


The jurisdiction under whose law the general partnership was formed immediately prior to the filing of the certificate of limited partnership;


If the former general partnership is registered with the Commission as a registered limited liability partnership, a statement to that effect;


A statement that the conversion of the general partnership to a limited partnership was approved by the partners in accordance with the provisions of subsection B.
